    "subtitle": "Collagen is the main structural protein found in our body's connective tissue (skin, joints, bones, hair, nails, muscles, and tendons). It supports beauty, skin elasticity and hydration, joint mobilit",
    "description": "Collagen is the main structural protein found in our body's connective tissue (skin, joints, bones, hair, nails, muscles, and tendons). It supports beauty, skin elasticity and hydration, joint mobility, bones, muscles, and general health of the connective tissue. HealthAid Marine Collagen Powder is rich in type 1 as well as type 2 and 3 Collagen. It is Hydrolysed to reduce the size of the Collagen molecules thus ensuring better absorption and bioavailability. Supplementing with natural collagen is essential for maintaining healthy-looking skin and joint mobility. The skin is the body’s largest organ and Collagen is the major structural protein of the skin, which gives it strength, smooth and glowing appearance. As we age, Collagen levels decline, and levels of free radicals in the skin increase due to the effects of exposure to harmful UV rays and environmental factors. Cosmetic creams, lotions and serums work on the top layer of skin – the epidermis. However, the skin’s overall quality, moisture-retaining ability and resilience are determined in the deeper, structural layer - the dermis – where the collagen, elastin and moisture-retaining elements are found. Hydrolysed Marine Collagen Powder acts as a skin rejuvenator from inside out because it is especially rich in the beneficial Type I Hydrolysed Collagen to provide the optimum support for healthy, glowing skin. Type I Hydrolysed Collagen is the most abundant in the body and is considered to be the key building matrix protein that gives the skin its structure and firmness. Being “hydrolysed” it has higher bioavailability (90-95%) and can be easily absorbed and transported to the dermis of the skin.",
