      "Οφέλη": "Aids normal brain and nervous system function\nIncreases energy level and reduces fatigue\nAssists in normal digestion and the assimilation of nutrients\nHelps maintain a healthy heart, liver and circulatory system\nContributes to the normal functioning of the immune system",
