      "Συστατικά": "Vitamin C (ascorbic acid, HPMC), Bulking Agent [hydroxy propyl methyl cellulose (HPMC), microcrystalline cellulose], Rosehip Powder (rosa canina), Anti-caking Agent (silica, veg. magnesium stearate), Stabiliser [crosslinked sodium carboxy methyl cellulose (SCMC)], Glazing Agent (SCMC, dextrin, dextrose, soy lecithin, sodium citrate), Acerola Powder, Hesperidin, Rutin\n\nΔιατροφικές πληροφορίες:\nAmount · %NRV\nVitamin C [Ascorbic Acid] · 1000mg · 1250\nRosehip powder · 50mg · *\nAcerola Powder · 25mg · *\nHesperidin · 20mg · *\nRutin · 20mg · *\n*: EC Nutrient Reference Value Not Yet Established\nNRV: EC Nutrient Reference Value\n*: EC Nutrient Reference Value Not Yet Established",
      "Χρήση": "Adults and children over 12 years of age, one tablet daily with food, preferably in the morning. Adults can take up to three tablets daily if required. Tablets to be swallowed whole. Do not exceed recommended daily intake unless advised by a suitably qualified person.",
